    ImportjsP = (ord(TagEnum.ImportjsTagId), "importjs")  ## the `{.importjs.}` **proc pragma**: a bodyless proc whose argument is the raw JavaScript splice template, in Nim 2's language (`#` consumes the next operand, `$1`/`$#` name the proc, `$$` a literal `$`, `@` spreads the operands left) so the existing `lib/js` binding declarations port verbatim. The template rides into the decl unchanged and is forwarded across Leng for the JS back end to splice at the call site; the C and native back ends have no lowering for it and reject the pragma.


